# Recorded input for the number field page (widgets/number.zig, `Page`), at 320 x 140 in the
# default theme: Quantity (0 to 10 by 1, at 3) at x 12..308, y 38..63, and Scale (-1 to 1 by
# 0.25, at 0.5) at x 12..308, y 97..122. One line per frame below (format: input.Replay).
# Scancodes: Up 82, Page Up 75, Enter 40.
# 0: rest
frame
viewport 320 140
dt 0.016
pointer 300 135
# 1: press Quantity: focused
frame
pointer 200 50
buttons left
# 2: release
frame
buttons
# 3: Up twice: 5
frame
press 82
press 82
# 4: Page Up: clamped to 10
frame
press 75
# 5: type 2 after it: "102", not taken yet
frame
text 2
# 6: Ctrl+A selects it, 2 replaces it, Enter takes it: 2
frame
press 4 ctrl
text 2
press 40
# 7: the pointer over Scale
frame
pointer 200 110
# 8: the wheel up three notches over Scale: clamped to 1
frame
wheel 0 3
# 9: and down a notch: 0.75
frame
wheel 0 -1
